# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
# Format: <from> <to> <status>
# Docusaurus copies static/ to build/ so this lands at docs.irsforge.com/_redirects.
#
# Two classes of rule here:
#
# 1. Specific bad paths discovered in the wild. /judges/quickstart/tour was the
#    one a user hit (intuitive guess: "tour nested under quickstart"). Tour is
#    actually a sibling page, not a child. The mirror direction (tour/quickstart)
#    is added preemptively for the same reason.
#
# 2. Category-level landings. The site has explicit category sidebars but no
#    routes at /judges, /concepts, /integrators, etc. — those all 404 today.
#    Each entry below redirects the bare category URL to the first page in that
#    sidebar section. A user who bookmarks "/concepts" gets the swpm-parity
#    page; we don't depend on them knowing the exact slug to type.
#
# Out of scope here: building real category index pages via
# `link: { type: 'generated-index' }` in sidebars.ts is the more native fix
# and would replace these redirects. Filed for follow-up.

# (1) specific bad-guesses
/judges/quickstart/tour       /judges/tour                                    301
/judges/tour/quickstart       /judges/quickstart                              301

# (2) category-level landings
/judges                       /judges/quickstart                              301
/getting-started              /getting-started/quickstart                     301
/concepts                     /concepts/swpm-parity                           301
/architecture                 /architecture/daml-finance-interfaces           301
/products                     /products/irs                                   301
/integrators                  /integrators/overview                           301
/oracle                       /oracle/overview                                301
/ui                           /ui/overview                                    301
/reference                    /reference/config-yaml                          301
/operations                   /operations/deploying-production                301
